'''New Year Cake''' is a {{Special}} item players can obtain from the {{NPCSprite|Baker}} every SkyBlock Year during the [[New Year Celebration]] (29-31 of Late Winter).

Each cake can only be claimed once per player, and is unique to the SkyBlock year it was received. This means cakes from previous years are no longer obtainable. The only way to get them is buying them from another player or the [[Auction House]].

This results in recent New Year Cakes fetching a low value in the Auction House, while certain cakes, mainly the first ten, year 69 and year 100 ([[Century Cake]]) are worth millions of coins each.

== Usage ==
New Year Cakes can be stored in the {{Item|New Year Cake Bag}}. Each cake from a SkyBlock year adds +1 {{stat|hp}} to the [[New Year Cake Bag]] while stored inside.

== Trivia ==
